VIBRIX

Global Communication Platform

VIBRIX is a global communication platform designed to help people connect through chat, video-call rooms, private conversations, and room discovery.

Stage One Objectives

- User registration and secure login
- User profiles
- Private messaging
- Room creation and discovery
- Video communication
- Secure wallet architecture
- Administrative and staff controls
- Security, testing, and production readiness

Development Principles

- Secure authentication and authorization
- Protect user privacy and financial records
- Keep financial transactions auditable
- Test features before production release
- Build in stages without silently removing approved requirements

